            "popup_role": "Medical Advisor — Hair & Scalp Health",
            "popup_bio": "<p>Dr. Soham specializes in hair thinning, scalp inflammation, and long-term follicle health. His work focuses on early intervention strategies and evidence-based topical therapies to improve hair density and reduce shedding progression. At Rituall, he oversees clinical protocols and ensures every formulation aligns with dermatological safety standards.</p>",
